# Design components first

UI in `packages/renderer` must prefer `@thinker-workbench/design/react` before inventing local buttons, inputs, toggles, or dialogs.

Import from `@thinker-workbench/design/react`. Global chrome: `@thinker-workbench/design/styles.less`; control styles: `@thinker-workbench/design/controls.less` (per-control `components/<Name>/<Name>.less`). Live catalog: app `#/components` (click a title for that folder’s `.md`).

## Catalog

| Control | Use for |
|---|---|
| `Button` | Labeled actions (`primary` / `secondary` / `ghost` / `text` / `danger`; `text` = inline “Try it” style) |
| `IconButton` | Icon-only actions (requires `aria-label`) |
| `*Icon` / `Icon` | Named SVG icons (`ChevronLeftIcon`, …); 16×16 / stroke 1.5; catalog via `listDesignIcons()` |
| `Input` / `TextArea` | Text fields (spellcheck / autofill off by default) |
| `Field` | Label + description + error around a control |
| `Select` | Single choice listbox (portaled menu) |
| `SegmentedControl` | Compact 2–3 choice toggle |
| `Switch` / `Checkbox` / `RadioGroup` | Boolean / multi-option toggles |
| `Modal` | Dialogs (backdrop dismiss opt-in) |
| `ChoiceCard` | Selectable option cards (e.g. theme pickers) |
| `SideNavItem` | Side navigation rows |
| `Kbd` | Shortcut keycaps |
| `Badge` | Small status chips |
| `Callout` | Inline info / warning / danger notices |
| `EmptyState` | Empty placeholders + optional action |
| `Spinner` / `Progress` | Loading / progress |
| `Separator` | Dividers |
| `Masonry` | Waterfall / masonry grid (shortest-column packing) |
| `ThemeProvider` / `useDesignTheme` | Theme host (already wired in app) |

## Do

- Reuse an existing control; extend it in `packages/design` if the pattern will be shared
- Match existing `variant` / `size` / token usage; avoid one-off colors in feature Less
- Preview new shared controls on the Components page when adding to the library
- New shared control = `packages/design/src/components/<Name>/{Name}.tsx, Name.less, Name.md}`, wired into `styles/controls.less` and `react/index.ts`

## Do not

- Hand-roll `<button>` / `<input>` / `<select>` / checkbox chrome when a design control fits
- Duplicate settings-switch / modal / select styling in `packages/renderer/src/styles.less`
- Put reusable control implementations in `renderer` — they belong in `packages/design`

## Exceptions

- OS / window chrome (e.g. Windows title-bar controls) may stay app-local
- Pure layout wrappers and one-off SVG glyphs inside a design control are fine
- If nothing in the catalog fits and the UI is not reusable, a local control is OK — note why briefly in the PR/commit
